It should keep the source between html prettier-ignore-start and prettier-ignore-end
<div   class="before">{{ a  }}</div>
<!-- prettier-ignore-start -->
<div   class="custom-layout">
    {{ some_variable | complicated_filter: foo: bar }}
      {% render 'component', foo: bar %}
</div>
<p>{{   b }}</p>
<!-- prettier-ignore-end -->
<div   class="after">{{ c  }}</div>

It should keep the source between liquid inline prettier-ignore comments
{% # prettier-ignore-start %}
{%if   a%}<b>{{x}}</b>{%endif%}
{%  cycle a,b,c %}
{% # prettier-ignore-end %}
{%if   a%}<b>{{x}}</b>{%endif%}

It should keep the source between liquid comment tag prettier-ignore comments
{% comment %} prettier-ignore-start {% endcomment %}
{%if   a%}<b>{{x}}</b>{%endif%}
{% comment %} prettier-ignore-end {% endcomment %}
{%if   a%}<b>{{x}}</b>{%endif%}

It should support ranges inside elements
<section>
<div>
<!-- prettier-ignore-start -->
<b>{{   x }}</b>   <i>{{   y }}</i>
<!-- prettier-ignore-end -->
<u>{{   z }}</u>
</div>
</section>

It should ignore until the end of the parent when there is no prettier-ignore-end
<div>
<!-- prettier-ignore-start -->
<b>{{   x }}</b>
  <i>{{   y }}</i>
</div>
<u>{{   z }}</u>
